                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "The concept is great but there are so many questionable design decisions.  \nThe game could be completely playable with the mouse yet forces you to use keyboard.  \nThe UI is confusing or barebones and the tutorial hardly communicates the mechanics of the game. The UI also always assumes you have a controller connected.  \nThe pace of the game is too fast. I'm sure there is a steep learning curve that, once passing, makes the game far more enjoyable, but it's not very satisfying.   \nThe game does have upgrades and progression is almost always welcome, in a game.\nSome of the art is well done and I sincerily enjoy the concept of balancing your movement with your defense, but this game was released far too early. It needs more testing and redesign, and with a little polish could actually turn into a quite fun game.",
